{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689930/extras/588849b021e44e78eecf865d8d569368.avif?t=1758890854\" width=602 height=200 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689930/extras/dbcdbd4cf2b631d68e70b7911d767e8b.avif?t=1758890854\" width=602 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Detective Instinct: Farewell, My Beloved</strong> is a brand new Detective ADV/Visual Novel, in the style of classic adventure games from Japan. Investigate areas and interrogate witnesses on the path towards solving the mystery and uncovering a sinister conspiracy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dramatic and moving story, inspired by hard-boiled crime fiction, classic cinema, and other classic adventure (ADV) games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic command-select gameplay, designed to maximize player experimentation and deduction while minimizing the need to brute force solutions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique mixed-media art style, combining highly expressive 2D pixel art portraits, old-school pre-rendered 3D backgrounds, and traditional illustrations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A colorful cast of characters with which to converse, with many unique interactions and optional dialogue that rewards exploration and curiosity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lavish original soundtrack in various musical styles, featuring many live instrument performances</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689930/extras/f75f73f3ee919185f2d2f27ca632a21d.avif?t=1758890854\" width=604 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689930/extras/79402128f0be9899c686638a9d827514.avif?t=1758890854\" width=604 height=150 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2689930?t=1758890854","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689930/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758890854","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689930/5c278457870cc4c69011bc235ba0839251a1fd9f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758890854","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689930/5c278457870cc4c69011bc235ba0839251a1fd9f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758890854","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game features a story centered around murder and implied violent criminal activity. It does not feature graphic depictions of violence."},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2989360,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689930/extras/588849b021e44e78eecf865d8d569368.avif?t=1758890854\" width=602 height=200 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689930/extras/dbcdbd4cf2b631d68e70b7911d767e8b.avif?t=1758890854\" width=602 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Detective Instinct: Farewell, My Beloved</strong> is a brand new Detective ADV/Visual Novel, in the style of classic adventure games from Japan. Investigate areas and interrogate witnesses on the path towards solving the mystery and uncovering a sinister conspiracy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dramatic and moving story, inspired by hard-boiled crime fiction, classic cinema, and other classic adventure (ADV) games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic command-select gameplay, designed to maximize player experimentation and deduction while minimizing the need to brute force solutions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique mixed-media art style, combining highly expressive 2D pixel art portraits, old-school pre-rendered 3D backgrounds, and traditional illustrations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A colorful cast of characters with which to converse, with many unique interactions and optional dialogue that rewards exploration and curiosity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lavish original soundtrack in various musical styles, featuring many live instrument performances</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689930/extras/f75f73f3ee919185f2d2f27ca632a21d.avif?t=1758890854\" width=604 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689930/extras/79402128f0be9899c686638a9d827514.avif?t=1758890854\" width=604 height=150 /></span></p>","developers":["Armonica LLC"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_ite